    unavailable/source mismatch, negative/nonfinite rejection and finite saturation. This specifies
    the finite algorithm, not acceptable image or approximation error. The first two fixture failures
    exposed unsupported map width and unintended scenario-driven detail; both fixture inputs were
    corrected. The metadata-sum comparison uses a documented 64-term binary32 summation-error bound
