  Algorithm -> evaluate each positive-weight texel-center 2x2 tap's finite ShadowDistance window
    against its own chord/segments. Average exp(-tau) and exp(-octaveExtinction*tau) independently;
    never interpolate optical depth, metadata flags or derive the octave from averaged direct light.
    Valid empty coverage contributes one. Missing/source-mismatched/nonfinite contributing data or
    an out-of-map contributing tap replaces the complete query with bounded marching. Exact zero
    weights require no tap; edge coverage is neither clamped nor renormalized around missing rays.
  Correctness -> artifacts/CloudRealtime/phase8.2/focused.trx and filter.trx -> nine unique ordinary
